ob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-2108.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1180","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1180.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1557","title":"Ipswitch IMail IMAP 服务器缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Ipswitch IMail 5.0 及更早版本的 IMAP 服务组件（imapd）的登录功能存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向服务器发送超长的用户名或密码参数触发该漏洞，导致 imapd 进程崩溃并造成拒绝服务，在特定条件下可能实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Ipswitch IMail 5.0 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1557"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2005-05-02T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:42Z","remediation":"升级 Ipswitch IMail 至 5.0 以上版本以修复 imapd 登录函数缓冲区溢出漏洞。如无法升级，建议在防火墙上禁用 IMAP 端口 143 的外部访问，或直接停止 IMAP 服务，仅使用 POP3 替代。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=92038879607336&w=2","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1895","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19377","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e37edb84f090321c2ab4b4aefc57f84a75b1b940/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1557.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1557","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-1999-1557.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f73aeebc806b7ab5e9488498a056b9fa7bf30dd7/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1557.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/26d7afd7aa97d50454756aec5636fa553464ffd2/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5fwq-v23g-x73p/GHSA-5fwq-v23g-x73p.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/I/imail_imapd_overflow.nasl","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87973/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1557.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/c51ad86fdcd385e00e18d9d5ea4cfa55540e5dc1/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1180.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1090","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1090.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1374","title":"PerlShop perlshop.cgi 敏感信息泄露漏洞","description":"perlshop.cgi 购物车程序存在敏感信息泄露漏洞，该程序将客户敏感信息（如订单详情、个人数据等）存储在 Web 根目录下的目录和文件中，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过直接发送 HTTP 请求访问这些文件，从而获取客户隐私数据。该漏洞影响使用 perlshop.cgi 的早期 Perl 购物车系统，危害等级中等，攻击复杂度低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1374"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2005-05-02T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:18Z","remediation":"将 perlshop.cgi 的 data_dir 配置参数指向 Web 根目录之外（如 /var/lib/perlshop/data），并确保该目录权限设置为 700（仅运行 httpd 的用户可读写）。同时修改 shop.cfg 中 `$data_dir` 变量为绝对路径的外部目录，并在 Apache 配置中添加 `<DirectoryMatch /shop/data>` 拒绝规则以阻止直接访问遗留数据文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=92523159819402&w=2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/36911ad057245f7d02822794db0f459d9b4c9b8f/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1374.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1374","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1374.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3012e5f1cf9bcfe839897275a956236aed334269/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1374.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d56576b8850027b4a8571fd52a8c5fe418f01987/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8c22-q5q8-5fgr/GHSA-8c22-q5q8-5fgr.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/dangerous_cgis.nasl","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1374.json","https://github.com/magicsword-io/Magic-SigExplorer/blob/2c28b91b003429a144a687199ee99ebd26f1a343/Magic-SigExplorer/docs/cve_report.md","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--3cdf80e7-0745-4b2a-80f4-c36568926ebf.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idinfor"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1090.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-1090.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1090.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1104","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1104.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1431","title":"Microsoft Zero Administration Kit (ZAK) 安全策略绕过漏洞","description":"Microsoft Zero Administration Kit (ZAK) 1.0 的 Appstation 模式存在安全策略绕过漏洞。在应用白名单机制下，用户可通过 Office 97（如 Word）启动资源管理器 Explorer，进而将恶意软件安装至 TEMP 目录并重命名为允许执行的应用名称（如 Winword.exe），从而绕过\"仅允许运行指定应用\"策略。该漏洞允许受限用户在目标系统上执行任意未经授权的程序，破坏了 ZAK 的安全隔离机制。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1431"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2005-01-07T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:25Z","remediation":"此漏洞存在于 ZAK 1.0 及 Office 97 环境中，建议升级至 Windows 2000 及以上版本，使用组策略（GPO）中的软件限制策略替代 ZAK，并启用 AppLocker（Windows 7+/Server 2008 R2+）限制非授权程序运行。同时限制用户对 TEMP 目录的写入权限，移除不必要的 Office 97 组件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=91576100022688&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=91606260910008&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/181","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19144","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/48e2428aa9b9856f01006cca01971bc2ae076616/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1431.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1431","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1431.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/715601c34bbee046275188561ed6152c0e14bde6/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1431.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/de3f834577328e71a123358d1db2b1637bc19e8a/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-q7hj-hx26-wwww/GHSA-q7hj-hx26-wwww.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1431.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_139200_139300.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--4c7f1cef-cea9-488c-aedb-0aba038196cc.json","https://github.com/akabe1/windows_exploit_dowser/blob/11b24e36173cd382721db28581e575faf687d06b/cve_from_exploitdb_website.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1104.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1089","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1089.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1373","title":"FORE PowerHub 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"FORE PowerHub 5.0.0 存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者可通过发送带有 TCP/IP 操作系统指纹识别的 TCP SYN 扫描数据包（如使用 nmap 工具）触发该漏洞，导致目标设备挂起或停止响应。该漏洞影响 FORE PowerHub 5.0.1 之前的所有版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，危害程度中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1373"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2005-01-05T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:18Z","remediation":"升级 FORE PowerHub 至 5.0.1 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。临时缓解措施可在网络边界防火墙配置规则，限制对 PowerHub 设备的 TCP SYN 扫描探测，或部署入侵检测系统 (IDS) 拦截异常的 TCP 探测流量。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=91651770130771&w=2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/41de94138b7cf6e858138ec4e79e16fbec611fa4/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1373.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1373","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1373.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3012e5f1cf9bcfe839897275a956236aed334269/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1373.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa37ed0317ce1265b487f92916077b9ccbfe3349/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2qrm-xmpc-h7fp/GHSA-2qrm-xmpc-h7fp.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1373.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_139200_139300.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/8108bbe4fb0e20671face287a302a062844c09bb/1999.tsv","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--b1fc5853-9330-4469-93c1-fb7c0bd43c5b.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1089.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1028","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1028.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1263","title":"Metamail uuencode 附件处理任意文件写入漏洞","description":"Metamail 2.7-7.2 之前版本中存在任意文件写入漏洞。远程攻击者可通过发送包含 uuencode 附件的恶意邮件，在附件中指定目标文件的完整路径名，Metamail 在处理邮件时调用 uuencode 脚本（如 sun-audio-file）将附件内容写入攻击者指定的任意路径，从而覆盖系统文件。攻击者无需身份认证即可利用此漏洞，可能导致系统文件被篡改或服务异常。该漏洞影响 Metamail 2.7-7.2 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 2.6，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1263"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2003-08-15T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:03Z","remediation":"升级 Metamail 至 2.7-7.2 及以上版本，该版本修复了 uuencode 脚本中未对附件路径进行安全检查的问题。同时建议在邮件客户端中禁用自动解码 uuencode 附件的功能，并配置邮件过滤器阻止含完整路径的 uuencode 附件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87773365324657&w=2","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1677","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bab2ad77526cf53e031dbf06b248b9bb97c66bc2/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1263.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1263","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1263.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4631642e37ce9ee8b9057e387df4aee61487fb70/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1263.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f37077e857e7a28bab83d284c23299407fb1af7e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xqm9-g4jx-xvgw/GHSA-xqm9-g4jx-xvgw.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1263.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_147200_147300.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--994159c6-4130-4132-93c9-332283f85f73.json","https://github.com/dong-xs/Vul-PAG/blob/7eb3b32094a5270cfd8495366e0e4a7df5a874ce/aspect_prediction/org_pred_diff.txt","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--994159c6-4130-4132-93c9-332283f85f73.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1028.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1192","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1192.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1570","title":"SCO OpenServer sar 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"OpenServer 5.0.5 系统中的 sar 工具存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向 -o 参数传递超长字符串触发该漏洞，导致缓冲区溢出，从而覆盖进程内存空间，最终获取系统 root 权限。该漏洞影响 OpenServer 5.0.5 版本，攻击者须拥有本地操作系统账户方可利用，无需网络远程访问。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1570"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2002-05-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:44Z","remediation":"建议安装 Caldera 安全公告 CSSA-2002-SCO.17 对应补丁，将 OpenServer 升级至修复版本。如无法立即打补丁，可执行 chmod u-s /usr/bin/sar 移除 sar 的 suid 权限，阻断本地普通用户通过该漏洞获取 root 提权的攻击路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=vuln-dev&m=102098949103708&w=2","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/27074","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8989.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4089","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4f761f58350f835cb02025d033f6f8c7f536e6b7/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1570.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1570","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-1999-1570.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2658816172d77941b1080be8784997934e564ee9/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1570.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/26d7afd7aa97d50454756aec5636fa553464ffd2/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-79g8-69hq-h5jh/GHSA-79g8-69hq-h5jh.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1570.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_148400_148500.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000857.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--96c29d61-6975-4ef5-bc9c-437c88134827.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1192.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0934","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0934.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1091","title":"tin rtin UNIX新闻阅读器符号链接攻击漏洞","description":"UNIX 系统下的新闻阅读器 tin 和 rtin 在创建临时日志文件 /tmp/.tin_log 时使用了不安全的文件权限，并且程序会跟随符号链接进行操作。本地攻击者可通过预先创建符号链接指向目标文件，诱使程序以当前用户权限修改链接指向文件的权限，属于典型的符号链接攻击（symlink attack）。该漏洞影响多种 UNIX 发行版本，攻击者需要具有本地系统访问权限，利用难度较低，可能造成敏感文件权限被非授权修改。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1091"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2002-01-15T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:42Z","remediation":"升级 tin 至 1.4 及以上版本，或 rtin 至更高版本，确保 /tmp/.tin_log 文件仅对当前用户可读写。如无法升级，可删除 /tmp/.tin_log 改为只读空文件并锁定权限，或使用 Sticky Bit 保护 /tmp 目录防止符号链接攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87602167419835&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87602167419839&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87602167420726&w=2","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/431","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7481e97cf7b60a5b982d99d7dad1ea61174940fb/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1091.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c1321b1a6b0cb3a4c18f791e2c8443742c0cb0b0/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1091.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1091","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1091.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/63d4031680b3d3fa77b826660a1e30ffc70ff5cd/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1091.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7cddb9480dac0125b9b2b00c91d6226d5d995ec7/1999/CVE-1999-1091.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3508ccc52a2baed6a1946843005e8957c7067f39/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-10xx/CVE-1999-1091.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1091.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1091.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-1999-1091.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0934.toml"}]